Input 30 features x 1 > Conv1D 64 filters k3 ReLU: Time, V1..V28, Amount (Time and Amount scaled)
Conv1D 64 filters k3 ReLU > Batch normalisation 1
Batch normalisation 1 > Conv1D 128 filters k3 ReLU
Conv1D 128 filters k3 ReLU > Batch normalisation 2
Batch normalisation 2 > Conv1D 256 filters k3 ReLU
Conv1D 256 filters k3 ReLU > Batch normalisation 3
Batch normalisation 3 > Global max pooling
Global max pooling > Dense 128 ReLU
Dense 128 ReLU > Dropout 0.4 (a)
Dropout 0.4 (a) > Dense 64 ReLU
Dense 64 ReLU > Dropout 0.4 (b)
Dropout 0.4 (b) > Dense 1 sigmoid
Dense 1 sigmoid > Fraud probability 0 to 1
